  "text": "About Us - Haven Lake Animal Hospital - Milford, DE\nMenu\nHome\nServices\nWellness Care\nCancer Care\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEnd of Life Care\nSurgery\nEchocardiograms\nEchocardiogram Form For Clients\nExotics\nAmphibian form\nAvian History Form\nReptile History Form\nSmall Mammal History Form\nI-131 Therapy\nResources\nPet Library\nPharmacy\nLinks\nPromotions\nAbout Us\nVeterinarians & Staff\nLeave a Review\nHospital Tour\nForms\nClient Information Form\nReferral Form\nRequest Appointment\nRx Refill\nI-131 Treatment Overview\nDental Release\nSurgical Release\nContact Us\nEmergencies\nOnline Store\n300 Milford Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\n(302) 422-8100\nHome\nServices\nWellness Care\nCancer Care\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEnd of Life Care\nSurgery\nEchocardiograms\nEchocardiogram Form For Clients\nExotics\nAmphibian form\nAvian History Form\nReptile History Form\nSmall Mammal History Form\nI-131 Therapy\nResources\nPet Library\nPharmacy\nLinks\nPromotions\nAbout Us\nVeterinarians & Staff\nLeave a Review\nHospital Tour\nForms\nClient Information Form\nReferral Form\nRequest Appointment\nRx Refill\nI-131 Treatment Overview\nDental Release\nSurgical Release\nContact Us\nEmergencies\nOnline Store\nAbout Us\nProcessing ....\nHaven Lake Animal Hospital\n300 Milford Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\n(302)422-8100\nwww.havenlakeanimalhospital.com\nA COMMITMENT TO CARE\nHaven Lake Animal Hospital first opened its doors to the pets of Delaware in 1999. Since then, we have established ourselves as Kent and Sussex counties’ premier veterinarians, servicing the communities of Milford, Dover, Milton, Lewes, Rehoboth, and beyond. Our practice is focused on dogs, cats, rabbits, ferrets, and rodents, and our services range from\nroutine preventive wellness\nand\ndental care\nto\nspecialized surgeries\nand\ncancer treatments\n.\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, it is our goal to provide our clients with compassionate and professional care. In an effort to better provide you with the service you and your pet deserve, we ask all our clients to please observe the following considerations:\nAppointment policy\n—Haven Lake Animal Hospital operates primarily by appointment, and we encourage our clients to schedule ahead whenever possible. However, as emergencies do arise, we will always give those cases top priority, and we ask for your understanding if a delay in your appointment is inevitable. We will always make our best effort to see each client at his or her appointed time.\nPatient arrival policy\n—Please be on time for your appointment. If you are running late, let us know. Additionally, for your pet’s safety (and the safety of others), please leash or crate your pet when bringing him or her into the office.\nPayment policy\n—We require full payment at the time services are rendered. For your convenience, we accept Visa, MasterCard, personal checks, cash, and\nCareCredit\n.\nPrivacy policy\n—Haven Lake Animal Hospital takes the privacy of our clients very seriously. We do not collect any information on our clients, nor do we sell or distribute any information to third-party vendors or Internet businesses.\nAbout Us\nVeterinarians & Staff\nReview Us\nHospital Tour\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, we understand that you may feel a bit overwhelmed by it all, but rest assured that we are here to help and guide you and your pet through the process and back to health. If your pet has not recently been in for an annual wellness exam or dental exam, is not current on his or her vaccinations, or has any other issues you are concerned about, please\ncontact us\nto schedule an appointment.\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, we understand that you may feel a bit overwhelmed by it all, but rest assured that we are here to help and guide you and your pet through the process and back to health. If your pet has not recently been in for an annual wellness exam or dental exam, is not current on his or her vaccinations, or has any other issues you are concerned about, please\ncontact us\nto schedule an appointment.\nWays to Connect:\nUse our\nonline forms\nto request an appointment, refill medication, or to pre-check in for procedures.\nSend a text to (302)422-8100 to check in for appointments or to ask a question.\nSend us an\nemail\nwith any question or concern.\nWe are here for you!\nContact Details\n300 Milford-Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\nTel:\n(302) 422-8100\nFax:\n(302) 422-6490\nEmail\n:\ninfo@havenlakeanimalhospital.com\nHospital Hours\nMon: 8:00am-6:00pm\nTue: 7:30am-6:00pm\nWed: 7:30am-6:00pm\nThur: 7:30am-6:00pm\nFri: 7:30 am-4:00pm\nSat: 8:00am-1:00pm\nSun: Closed\nBrought to you by\neVetSites®\nInspired by the VIN community, part of the VIN family",
